---
import { booking } from '../site';
---
<section class="mentor-band" aria-labelledby="mentor-band-h">
  <div class="wrap mentor-in">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Mentoring</p>
      <h2 id="mentor-band-h">Stuck between editorial and product? Let's talk it through.</h2>
      <p>I mentor and coach people in news product: getting started, stepping into a first management role, or leading change in an organisation that would rather not.</p>
      <blockquote class="band-quote"><p>“Nick has a great way of turning seemingly unsolvable issues into practical, tangible actions.”</p><footer>Joe Cawthorn</footer></blockquote>
      <p class="proof">More than 65 sessions since 2021.</p>
      <p class="actions"><a class="btn paper" href={booking}>Book a session</a> <a href="/mentoring/">How it works</a></p>
    </div>
    <ul class="mentor-facts">
      <li><b>Pay what you can</b>One-off sessions. £250 is the full rate; £1 is fine.</li>
      <li><b>Ongoing mentoring</b>Monthly spaces open from October 2026, over 3, 6 or 12 months.</li>
      <li><b>Ask your employer</b>Many will fund it as personal development.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
